  <!-- Notes: Both syllabi, MATH 13 and MATH 14, are PreTeXt articles in their own
       repositories, built and published exactly like the books; Camino's Syllabus and
       Syllabus PDF buttons point to them. The same section from the same file, as the
       website and as page 5 of the PDF. (These pictures were built from the repository's
       source for the slide.) -->
