    <p>Both from one file, <c>source/grading.ptx</c>, on every push: the <url href="https://mahmadi-ops.github.io/MATH13-Syllabus-Fall2026/">website</url> and the <url href="https://mahmadi-ops.github.io/MATH13-Syllabus-Fall2026/math13-syllabus-fall2026.pdf">PDF</url>.</p>
